    - target: {fileID: 7385412647217292329, guid: 3c65c5fcec52d6b4e8e210b612078d30, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Examine each subject and decide their fate.


        <B>PASS</B> -  subject is clear, no anomalies detected.


        <B>QUARANTINE</B> - symptoms present but reversible. Use when unsure.


        <B>KILL</B> - too many anomalies, subject is a threat.


        Work with your partner. Two sets of eyes are better than one.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
